{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o115b","title":"速仆丸与二袁逃辽东","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o115b-account","label":"正文","text":"速仆丸等弃部众，与袁尚、袁熙带数千骑逃往辽东。","evidence":["wudi-e-o115b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0246","role":"出奔","evidence":["wudi-e-o115b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0198","role":"出奔","evidence":["wudi-e-o115b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0221","role":"出奔","evidence":["wudi-e-o115b-q"]}],"place":{"text":"辽东","evidence":["wudi-e-o115b-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安十二年八月","year":207,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o115b-q","wudi-q-o111","wudi-q-b-fbc277caaf5ad8b958df"],"chronology":"wudi-y207","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o111","basis":"建安十二年八月","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,635,"O115b"],"order":257},{"id":"wudi-e-o117b","title":"公孙康杀二袁及速仆丸","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o117b-account","label":"正文","text":"公孙康斩袁尚、袁熙、速仆丸等，传送首级；曹操向诸将解释撤军使双方自行相图的考虑。","evidence":["wudi-e-o117b-q"]},{"id":"gongsuntao-a-2e0c89023b6e663aa636","label":"正文","text":"建安十二年太祖征乌丸屠柳城康斩送尚首","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-cfa6d629b8b47b2f49ed"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-d5ecc1a128174f730729","label":"正文","text":"辽东斩送袁尚首，令三军敢有哭之者斩；田畴以尝为尚所辟往吊祭，太祖亦不问","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-34572da0cb0069de028c"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0247","role":"杀送首级","evidence":["wudi-e-o117b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0198","role":"被杀","evidence":["wudi-e-o117b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0221","role":"被杀","evidence":["wudi-e-o117b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0246","role":"被杀","evidence":["wudi-e-o117b-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"解释决策","evidence":["wudi-e-o117b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0243","role":"以尝为袁尚所辟，乃往吊祭","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-34572da0cb0069de028c"]}],"place":{"text":"辽东","evidence":["wudi-e-o117b-q"]},"time":{"label":"曹军自柳城回师后","year":207,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o117b-q","wudi-q-o111","wudi-q-b-fbc277caaf5ad8b958df"],"chronology":"wudi-y207","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o111","basis":"曹军自柳城回师后","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,637,"O117b"],"related_events":[{"event":"dongyuan-e-o067a","type":"related","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o067a-q","wudi-e-o117b-q"]}],"order":260}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0246","name":"速仆丸","evidence":["wudi-q-o115"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-o115-wudi-p0246","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o115"]},{"id":"wudi-m-o117-wudi-p0246","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o117"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-o067a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-893eb6895390377ea179","layer":"original","quote":"十二年，太祖至辽西，击乌丸。尚、熙与乌丸，逆军战，败走奔辽东。公孙康诱斩之，送其首。﹝二﹞","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":374,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":45},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-cfa6d629b8b47b2f49ed","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-32cde7e21d373e6d01d7","layer":"original","quote":"十二年〖1〗，太祖征三郡乌丸，屠柳城。袁尚等奔辽东，康斩送尚首。语在《武纪》。封康襄平侯，拜左将军","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":191,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":26,"end":75},{"id":"wudi-e-o115b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1a17e5b34add834e2d76","layer":"original","quote":"辽东单于速仆丸及辽西、北平诸豪〖15〗，弃其种人〖16〗，与尚、熙奔辽东〖17〗，众尚有数千骑。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":634,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":97,"end":145},{"id":"wudi-e-o117b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-3982d5aa554a26f2c3db","layer":"original","quote":"康即斩尚、熙及速仆丸等，传其首。诸将或问：“公还而康斩送尚、熙，何也？”公曰：“彼素畏尚等，吾急之则并力，缓之则自相图；其势然也。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":636,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":14,"end":79},{"id":"wudi-q-b-fbc277caaf5ad8b958df","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-fbc277caaf5ad8b958df","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十二年：建安十二年（公元 207）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":623,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-20efb4f3aff50357a189","start":0,"end":21},{"id":"wudi-q-o111","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-01eaf58b917a530c61d5","layer":"original","quote":"十二年春二月〖1〗，公自淳于还邺。丁酉〖2〗，令曰：“吾起义兵诛暴乱，于今十九年；所征必克，岂吾功哉？乃贤士大夫之力也！天下虽未悉定，吾当要与贤士大夫共定之；而专享其劳〖3〗，吾何以安焉？其促定功行封〖4〗。”于是大封功臣二十余人，皆为列侯；其余各以次受封；及复死事之孤〖5〗：轻重各有差〖6〗。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":621,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":151},{"id":"wudi-q-o115","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1a17e5b34add834e2d76","layer":"original","quote":"八月，登白狼山〖11〗，猝与虏遇〖12〗。众甚盛。公车重在后，被甲者少〖13〗；左右皆惧。公登高，望虏阵不整，乃纵兵击之，使张辽为先锋；虏众大崩；斩蹋顿及名王以下〖14〗，胡、汉降者二十余万口。辽东单于速仆丸及辽西、北平诸豪〖15〗，弃其种人〖16〗，与尚、熙奔辽东〖17〗，众尚有数千骑。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":634,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":145},{"id":"wudi-q-o117","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-3982d5aa554a26f2c3db","layer":"original","quote":"九月，公引兵自柳城还。﹝一﹞康即斩尚、熙及速仆丸等，传其首。诸将或问：“公还而康斩送尚、熙，何也？”公曰：“彼素畏尚等，吾急之则并力，缓之则自相图；其势然也。”","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":636,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":80},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-34572da0cb0069de028c","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-980722d8367b4a4376f3","layer":"original","quote":"辽东斩送袁尚首，令三军：“敢有哭之者，斩！”畴以尝为尚所辟，乃往吊祭。太祖亦不问","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":230,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":81,"end":121}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
